            "value": "Checking a format makes FilePackr its default app; unchecking hands it back to another app that can open it. Some formats (7z, RAR…) have no other app, so they can't be unchecked. macOS asks you to confirm each change."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
